    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d902">

                <pb facs="1025" n="921" xml:id="pg921"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.1051/724: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Nicaragua</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hanna</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-12-22T11:00:00-05:00">December 22,
                            1932—11 a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>132. Your telegram No. 241, December 16. Department concurs in your modifications
                    and sincerely hopes, in the interests of Nicaragua, that the project may be
                    enacted at an early date.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
